{"parse":{"title":"特性/掠甲兽","pageid":7255,"revid":17263,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>掠甲兽</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8E.A0.E7.94.B2.E5.85.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"掠甲兽\"><b>掠甲兽</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 掠甲兽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d7/gzbqmwxsw9xwcoke305b2b1q4y7skuc.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d7/gzbqmwxsw9xwcoke305b2b1q4y7skuc.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d7/gzbqmwxsw9xwcoke305b2b1q4y7skuc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />掠甲兽\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦战斗开始时，获得8层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"角质壁垒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">角质壁垒</font></span></span>]；行动结束时，再获得8层；每次被伤害后移除1层。<br />✦行动开始时，若拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"角质壁垒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">角质壁垒</font></span></span>]，则获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">角质强化</span>]，效果：最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>。<br />✦失去所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"角质壁垒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">角质壁垒</font></span></span>]时，受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]。<br />✦当受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]时，自身弱化，并移除自身所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"角质壁垒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">角质壁垒</font></span></span>]。<br />✦若拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"角质壁垒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">角质壁垒</font></span></span>]并攻击敌人时，对其施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"衰弱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">衰弱</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。每拥有4层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"角质壁垒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">角质壁垒</font></span></span>]时，攻击后额外施加1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"衰弱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">衰弱</font></span></span>]。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>，免疫击退，免疫传送。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/掠甲兽\"><img alt=\"掠甲兽 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6d/7aknpoipiepy6ierdilzu26sc1zzjh1.png/75px-%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6d/7aknpoipiepy6ierdilzu26sc1zzjh1.png/113px-%E6%8E%A0%E7%94%B2%E5%85%BD_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6d/7aknpoipiepy6ierdilzu26sc1zzjh1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021175645\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.172 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1275/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21194/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4109/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expan